      50.82,
      330.31,
      286.64,
      493.62
    ],
    "text": "THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (Chapter 460) As Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 Notice under Section 7 Reference No.: KRP/LAND/ACQVI/01/16. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose Description of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.980000019073486,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.82,
      493.79,
      286.59,
      552.56
    ],
    "text": "The allotments of land shown in the plan of F.V.P. Mara 2578 and No. of diagram 91/8(0/20 3B) situated in the Village of Dewalamulla, Grama Niladari Division in Puhulwella West, Kirinda-Puhulwella Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division in Matara District.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      1.0199999809265137,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.82,
      552.86,
      286.54,
      611.23
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Kebellagahawatta; Description: Jungle; Extent: 0.0253 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.019999980926514,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.2,
      330.2,
      539.65,
      644.84
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired* are hereby required to appear or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Kirinda-Puhulwella of the 28th day of October, 2015 at 9.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 21st day of October, 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. R. S. L. CHINTHAKA ABEWICKRAMA, Divisional Secretary, Kirinda-Puhulwella. Divisional Secretariat Office Kirinda-Puhulwella 01st September, 2015. 09-474",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
